WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:10.180
Hey youtubers, it’s charlie and the moment
is finally here.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:11.380
Game of Thrones finally posted their first
full season 4 trailer.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:13.900
We also found out that episode 1 will premiere
april 6.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.830
Which is pretty close to when season 3 premiered
last year.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:25.849
Season 4 is going to be a little different
from previous seasons in that it’s going

00:00:25.849 --> 00:00:27.340
to change even more things from the books.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:33.410
So this video will be a detailed breakdown
of everything we see in the trailer.

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:39.350
I’ll also be doing a game of thrones q&amp;a
video tomorrow night, subscribe to get it

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:42.000
and post any questions about season 4 you
want me to include.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Careful for spoilers.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:53.039
I tried not to go too deep into what happens
outside of the scenes we see in the trailer.

00:00:53.039 --> 00:00:57.719
Time for dragons, let’s do this -

00:00:57.719 --> 00:01:01.300
1 - The trailer opens to a shot of a dragon
flying over kings landing.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:05.250
We only see the shadow, but chronologically
where things are in the books, none of the

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.250
dragons have left the east.

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:12.390
So if one does fly near the red keep it would
be a huge departure from canon.

00:01:12.390 --> 00:01:16.410
2 - Look at the wingspan of the dragon.

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:17.580
It’s huge now.

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:20.520
It almost looks like they’re jumping forward
in the story several months.

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:25.000
The dragons grow very fast in the books, but
drogon, the biggest isn’t this large until

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.000
dance with dragons.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.479
So assume that season 4 will include aspects
of book 5.

00:01:29.479 --> 00:01:31.469
3 - The purple wedding feast.

00:01:31.469 --> 00:01:33.820
This is the red wedding level event of season
4.

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:37.640
I won’t spoil what happens, but the voice
over from Jaime talks about how the people

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:38.719
love their king.

00:01:38.719 --> 00:01:41.960
Which is a play on the notion that everyone
wants Joffrey dead.

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:45.700
They’re referring to the war against stannis
and the battle of blackwater.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:47.850
In reality it was tyrion that saved the city.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:48.850
There have been a lot of behind the scenes
pictures of the set when they filmed these

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:49.850
scenes.

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:50.850
They had more extras on camera during the
purple wedding and the feast than in any other

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:51.850
episode with exception to the season 1 premiere.

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:52.850
4 - A feast for crows.

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:54.329
The crow is very symbolic to a song of ice
and fire, but visually in the trailer it’s

00:01:54.329 --> 00:01:56.780
a reference to book 4 a feast for crows.

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:59.910
It’s the idea that the dead are starting
to pile up.

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:03.320
5 - Daeneriss and ser friendzone start to
march their army to Mereen.

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:04.320
It’s the next major conflict and right now
we don’t know how much of that plot season

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:05.320
4 will include.

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:06.320
Her story is relatively static once she gets
there.

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:07.320
So they would have to depart from the book
plot a lot to move her around more.

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:08.429
6 - The charger barreling down daeneriss is
possibly one of the sons of the harpy one

00:02:08.429 --> 00:02:09.429
of the mercenary bands in mereen.

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:10.429
7 - The new daario.

00:02:10.429 --> 00:02:14.570
the actor playing daario was recast and this
is the first shot of him we get to see.

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:20.650
He was just upgraded to a regular cast member
for season 5, much to the chagrin of ser friendzone.

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:23.060
8 - These are the slaves of Mereen.

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:29.380
Remember last season dany had dedicated her
army to abolishing slavery in the major cities.

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:33.390
9 - Stannis and melisandre make ready for
the wall.

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:37.320
Remember last season during the finale stannis
had pledged to take his forces to fight the

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.340
white walkers.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.320
10 - Tyrion in peril.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:42.050
This season is a big turning point for tyrion.

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:43.050
This shot is before the worst of it.

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:44.050
He ends up in a mutual arrangement with the
red viper.

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:45.960
That look on his face is the ‘i think everyone
is trying to kill me face’.

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:48.820
11 - Jaime tries to end the seige of riverrun.

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:52.630
Even after the red wedding, the blackfish
is still alive and pissed that his entire

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:54.130
family was murdered.

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:59.630
12 - Stannis and his army actually sailing
to eastwatch the easternmost part of the wall.

00:02:59.630 --> 00:03:03.300
13 - Ser friendzone counsels daneriss about
her new role in mereen.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:06.670
She wants to get rid of slavery, but it’s
not quite as black and white like when she

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:08.090
liberated the unsullied and the slaves in
yunkai.

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:11.260
So she has to start making deals with people
instead of feeding them to her dragons.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:13.130
14 - The sons of the harpy attack.

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:16.000
Once daneriss occupies mereen the fighting
doesn’t end.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:21.300
The sons of the harpy start fighting a shadow
war against her unsullied and the other mercenaries

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:22.710
she comes to rely on.

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:25.270
In the books they’re called the shavepates
and the freedmen.

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:27.340
15 - This is hizdar zo loraq.

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:31.900
He’s a very powerful person in mereen that
dany has to decide whether or not to marry

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:34.080
to end the shadow war and abolish slavery.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:37.670
As he controls both the sons of the harpy
and the slave trade.

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:39.470
16 - Dany’s voiceover.

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:43.410
She’s talking about giving the mercenaries
of mereen the option of either accepting that

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:46.250
she’s abolishing slavery or they can die.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:49.160
17 - This is jaime weilding oathkeeper.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:54.110
It was one of the new valyrian blades made
by melting down ice, Eddard starks huge two

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:55.130
handed greatsword.

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:59.400
It’s the closest thing to a light saber
in a song of ice and fire.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.250
18 - Tyrion on trial.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:04.700
This is tyrion facing judgement after the
events of the purple wedding feast.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:05.910
Which I will not utter here.

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:07.930
Let’s just say he’s in deep shit.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.680
19 - Tyrion in jail.

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:14.550
As you can guess, he gets thrown in jail after
the purple wedding feast.

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:18.320
20 - The red viper.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:21.930
This is our first real shot of pedro pascal
as the red viper.

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:26.560
21 - Eegritte is back, she’s super pissed
and the wildlings have reached the night’s

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:27.560
watch.

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:30.090
Their mission last season was to take the
night’s watch from the other side of the

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:35.229
wall and open the gates so mance rayder could
bring his army of wildlings through.

00:04:35.229 --> 00:04:36.229
as seen here.

00:04:36.229 --> 00:04:39.460
22 - Jon Snow prepares everyone to fight the
wilding raiding party

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:44.479
23 - This is one of mance’s giants that
we saw pounding posts into the ground with

00:04:44.479 --> 00:04:45.669
their bare fists.

00:04:45.669 --> 00:04:48.449
You can’t tell the scale from here, but
those gates are huge.

00:04:48.449 --> 00:04:52.210
24 - Yara Greyjoy takes her forces to look
for theon.

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:55.520
In the books her name was asha, but they changed
it on the show.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:58.060
25 - Jaime gets fitted for his golden hand.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:01.110
Seriously, it’s a hand made out of gold.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:03.849
26 - Cersei post purple wedding.

00:05:03.849 --> 00:05:07.919
27 - This is one of the night’s watch brothers
offering up his baby to the children of the

00:05:07.919 --> 00:05:08.919
forest.

00:05:08.919 --> 00:05:12.990
It’s what old craster was going to do with
gilly’s baby since it was a boy.

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:15.509
28 - Arya starts to travels east.

00:05:15.509 --> 00:05:19.060
29 - Littlefinger and vary’s scrambling
post-purple wedding.

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:23.389
30 - The red viper tries to get help from
tyrion learning the truth about his sister,

00:05:23.389 --> 00:05:26.050
murdered wife of rhaegar targaryen.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:29.930
31 - This is the epic fight between the red
viper and the mountain.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:31.669
The mountain was recast again.

00:05:31.669 --> 00:05:34.280
Just to make him look even bigger and scarier.

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:38.880
32 - Joffrey and margeary at the actual purple
wedding ceremony.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:43.650
Also one of the biggest scenes they’ve filmed
since the show started.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:47.310
33 - Jaime with golden hand takes over the
gold cloaks.

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:50.509
Brienne really rubbed off on him, so he starts
trying to be honorable.

00:05:50.509 --> 00:05:56.000
34 - Rewind a bunch, this scene is between
jaime and cersei right after he gets back

00:05:56.000 --> 00:06:00.139
and before he gets that golden hand.

00:06:00.139 --> 00:06:03.340
Chronologically it’s probably a scene from
episode 1.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:06.610
35 - The night’s watch prepare for the big
battle with the wildlings.

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:09.550
Which you can also see attacking in this next
scene.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:12.370
36 - more from the purple wedding feast.

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:14.330
notice what that servant is carrying.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:16.969
It’s very very important.

00:06:16.969 --> 00:06:21.409
37 - Looks like theon made it out of that
dungeon, minus a few body parts.

00:06:21.409 --> 00:06:23.550
The character’s transformation is very different
from the books.

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:24.629
It looks like he made it to Stannis’s army
en route to the wall.

00:06:24.629 --> 00:06:28.199
38 - This is the first good shot of the new
actor playing the mountain.

00:06:28.199 --> 00:06:30.330
Yeah, he’s big.

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:33.999
39 - This is melisandre talking to gilly at
the wall.

00:06:33.999 --> 00:06:39.349
40 - This is jenyne poole who the lannisters
marry to ramsay snow, she’s pretending to

00:06:39.349 --> 00:06:41.889
be arya stark and they’re at winterfell.

00:06:41.889 --> 00:06:43.629
Ramsay snow is basically made ruler there.

00:06:43.629 --> 00:06:46.729
So they’re probably in eddard starks bedroom
right now.

00:06:46.729 --> 00:06:51.360
41 - This is sansa in the eyrie, littlefinger
takes her there after the events of the purple

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:52.360
wedding.

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:53.969
Remember catylin’s sister is the ruler there.

00:06:53.969 --> 00:06:55.139
She’s totally nutters.

00:06:55.139 --> 00:06:58.629
42 - Arya and the hound are still in the riverlands.

00:06:58.629 --> 00:07:02.199
This scene happens before the first shot we
saw of her earlier in the trailer where she

00:07:02.199 --> 00:07:03.199
wasn’t with the hound.

00:07:03.199 --> 00:07:07.050
43 - Dany addressing the newly freed slaves
from yunkai.

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:10.309
This happens right after the events of the
season 3 finale.

00:07:10.309 --> 00:07:14.080
So the trailer is jumping back and forth in
the season 4 timeline.

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:15.939
44 - Tyrion gets thrown in the black cells.

00:07:15.939 --> 00:07:20.610
That’s where they threw eddard stark before
he was beheaded in season 1 and tyrion threw

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:25.189
maester pycelle in there during season 2.

00:07:25.189 --> 00:07:29.220
45 - Notice the yellow banner.

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:33.180
This is stannis’ army racing to help the
night’s watch fight the wildlings.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.509
Looks like they’ll get there just in time.

00:07:34.509 --> 00:07:40.400
I’ll say that the moments I’m looking
forward to most are the battle at the wall

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:41.610
and the purple wedding.

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:44.439
Let me know what you’re most excited to
see.

00:07:44.439 --> 00:07:47.969
The trailer kind of implied that we would
see a full sized dragon.

00:07:47.969 --> 00:07:50.789
But I’m not going to hold my breath.

00:07:50.789 --> 00:07:53.550
This year I’ll be doing special game of
thrones videos for each episode.

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:56.919
I’ll do reviews right after episodes air
and then just like my sherlock videos I’ll

00:07:56.919 --> 00:07:58.020
do a q&amp;a video the day after.

00:07:58.020 --> 00:07:59.031
I’m also doing a fun game to guess the kill
order.

